  ex:ix-size-title rdf:type cd:Interpretation ;
    skos:prefLabel "What changes when six repeats become thirty"@en ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean .
  ex:ix-square-f rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:FormulaRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "3"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "cd:latex" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ix-square .
  ex:ix-square-h rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:HeadingRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "1"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "skos:prefLabel@en" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ix-square-title .
  ex:ix-square-scene dct:subject ex:l5-topic-chi ;
    rdf:type cd:SceneDefinition ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:focusConcept ex:al-chi-square ;
    cd:hasSceneItem ex:ix-square-f ;
    cd:hasSceneItem ex:ix-square-h ;
    cd:hasSceneItem ex:ix-square-v ;
    cd:narration "Return to a single standard-normal draw. Its sign gives direction, but variance uses squared distances. Both tails fold onto one nonnegative axis after squaring. The resulting one-df chi-square law is strongly right-skewed. Zero is in the support but has no point probability, just as any exact value of a continuous variable. The graphic is schematic; the formula specifies the exact law. We have not yet applied this to centered IC residuals."@en .
  ex:ix-square-title rdf:type cd:Interpretation ;
    skos:prefLabel "From one normal draw to one squared distance"@en ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean .
  ex:ix-square-v rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:MediaRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "2"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "cd:uri" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ix-square-media .
  ex:ix-sum-f rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:FormulaRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "3"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "cd:latex" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ix-sum .
  ex:ix-sum-h rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:HeadingRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "1"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "skos:prefLabel@en" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ix-sum-title .
  ex:ix-sum-title rdf:type cd:Interpretation ;
    skos:prefLabel "Add independent squares to construct chi-square"@en ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean .
}

<https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/graph/scenes/level5-ic-precision> {
  ex:ic-deviations-h rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:HeadingRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "1"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "skos:prefLabel@en" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ic-deviations-title .
  ex:ic-deviations-t rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:TableRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "2"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "cd:hasTableRow" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ic-deviation-table .
  ex:ic-deviations-title rdf:type cd:Interpretation ;
    skos:prefLabel "First describe today's spread; judge its rarity afterward"@en ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean .
  ex:ic-repeated-h rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:HeadingRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "1"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "skos:prefLabel@en" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ic-repeated-title .
  ex:ic-repeated-title rdf:type cd:Interpretation ;
    skos:prefLabel "What variance estimates would an unchanged method produce"@en ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean .
  ex:ic-squares dct:subject ex:l5-topic-chi ;
    rdf:type cd:SceneDefinition ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:focusConcept ex:al-chi-square ;
    cd:hasSceneItem ex:ic-squares-c ;
    cd:hasSceneItem ex:ic-squares-f ;
    cd:hasSceneItem ex:ic-squares-h ;
    cd:hasSceneItem ex:ic-squares-v ;
    cd:narration "Divide each deviation from mean 10.05 by reference SD 0.10 mg/L. For the 9.85 result, minus 0.20 divided by 0.10 is minus two; squaring gives four. The six scaled residuals are -1, 1, -2, 2, -1, 1. Their squared sum is twelve. Equivalently divide the original squared sum 0.12 by reference variance 0.01, or multiply sample variance 0.024 by five and divide by 0.01. Units cancel. The five-df normal-model reference calibrates this dimensionless statistic; the six centered residuals themselves are not independent standard normals."@en .
  ex:ic-squares-c rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:DefinitionListRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "3"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "cd:hasDefinitionListEntry" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ic-q-context .
  ex:ic-squares-f rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:FormulaRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "4"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "cd:latex" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ic-q .
  ex:ic-squares-h rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:HeadingRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "1"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "skos:prefLabel@en" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ic-squares-title .
  ex:ic-squares-title rdf:type cd:Interpretation ;
    skos:prefLabel "Scale, square and add: the observed statistic is 12"@en ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean .
  ex:ic-squares-v rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:MediaRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "2"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "cd:uri" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ic-residual-media .
  ex:ic-test dct:subject ex:l5-topic-chi ;
    rdf:type cd:SceneDefinition ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:focusConcept ex:al-chi-square ;
    cd:hasSceneItem ex:ic-test-c ;
    cd:hasSceneItem ex:ic-test-f ;
    cd:hasSceneItem ex:ic-test-h ;
    cd:hasSceneItem ex:ic-test-v ;
    cd:narration "State the predeclared hypotheses: true repeatability SD at most 0.10 mg/L versus larger SD. At the boundary, a chi-square-five statistic exceeds twelve with probability 0.0347878, about 3.48 percent. The orange region depicts that upper tail, not the probability the null is true. The upper five-percent critical value is 11.0704977, shown by the dashed line. Twelve exceeds it, so reject no deterioration at the chosen five-percent level under the assumptions. The boundary controls the composite null because a smaller true SD shifts Q down. This supplies evidence of poorer repeatability and supports investigating the analytical system under the laboratory's procedure. It does not diagnose an ageing column or itself authorize or prohibit release of real sample results. Bias, calibration and matrix effects are different questions. Reference SD estimation uncertainty, nonnormality or dependence would require a different justified calibration."@en .
  ex:ic-test-c rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:DefinitionListRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "3"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "cd:hasDefinitionListEntry" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ic-decision-context .
  ex:ic-test-f rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:FormulaRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "4"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "cd:latex" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ic-decision .
  ex:ic-test-h rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:HeadingRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "1"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "skos:prefLabel@en" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ic-test-title .
  ex:ic-test-title rdf:type cd:Interpretation ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 exceeds 11.07: evidence of poorer IC repeatability"@en ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean .
  ex:ic-test-v rdf:type cd:SceneItem ;
    cd:authoredResource "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    cd:communicativeRole cd:MediaRole ;
    cd:language "en" ;
    cd:position "2"^^xsd:integer ;
    cd:selectionPath "cd:uri" ;
    cd:selectsResource ex:ic-tail-media .
}

